","title":"< no title >","time":795667737,"poster":"Lzw",]),(["id":366,"title":"about PK!","body":"Tjis is angel......

I think player can do what he like in mud if doesn't violate Rules....

Monk cannot Pk others! but if any guy that is EVIL (PK others, war no shout...)
i allow u goto PK him!!! that is what a monk should do!!!

so Monk rule is:
1. If u Pk others no reasons, and the PKED die player post here or tell me!
After my checking... if no reasons... i will put u out of monk guild( not del file now:))
2. If any monk find a EVIL guy... he can post here, then goto PK him....

If any question, i will come here and ask all monks votings... :P

any way... Lzt(?) say he want to PK monks lo, so u all can PK him!
If any guy PK monk, plz post here, then all can PK him!!!

Monk need exercise, so.... plz be care la!!!!

(and ... mud is mud la!... he can PK u, U can ask all Pk him!,
but game is game.... dont be hurt too much :P)
